{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/971706764/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1792168938000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7649979/2026/10/15/aj-dybantsa-wizards-path-byu-brockton/?unlocked_article_code=1.I1E.CTaI.wcpspKMn9axJ&amp;source=emp_shared_article&amp;smid=url-share-ta\" target=\"_blank\">Can Dybantsa (and others) turn around the Wizards?</a> (NYT)</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/nickcammarata/status/2110757819427574056\" target=\"_blank\">Claims about interpretability</a>.  I have to say I do not quite “get it”…?  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MajmudarAdam/status/2110831397321740387\" target=\"_blank\">some exposition</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/logorrhythmic/status/2110770117290401958\" target=\"_blank\">90% of Americans’ working hours are spent on tasks not covered well by AI benchmarks. That’s our best guess from a new project mapping frontier benchmarks onto the US economy.</a>”  Study <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.mercor.com/research/labor-index/benchmark-map/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thefp.com/p/ross-douthat-how-to-survive-the-robot-apocalypse-ai-tech-doom\" target=\"_blank\">Ross Douthat (The Free Press) on how to survive the robot apocalypse</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.razibkhan.com/p/jonathan-beauchamp-genoeconomics?utm_source=podcast-email%2Csubstack&amp;publication_id=94899&amp;post_id=220598489&amp;utm_campaign=email-play-on-substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=play_card_post_title&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">Jonathan Beauchamp podcast on genonomics</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.economicforces.xyz/p/robert-hall-optimal-money-and-the?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=86578&amp;post_id=220579597&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">More Bob Hall on monetary economics</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.equator.org/articles/arundhati-roy-artificial-intelligence\" target=\"_blank\">Arundhati Roy is upset at AI</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/EricLDaugh/status/2110900685185101880\" target=\"_blank\">Flying car, at least for a bit</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Kalshi/status/2110901757496959481\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.  As Roon points out, they offer you the characters too!</p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.commonreader.co.uk/p/nothing-is-boring-in-america?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=120973&amp;post_id=220625414&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Henry Oliver on the Mid-South</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/friday-assorted-links-595.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/971706764/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/971706764/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20